WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.760
DM: [clears throat] Okay.

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.420
Unknown: [clears throat]

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.420
DM: So just jump right in.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.520
DM: Um, so both of you have spent most of the...

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.700
DM: Both Drakard and Kenzo have spent most of the, the week,

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.860
DM: 10 days that you've, that you've all been just kind of hanging out in Carrol,

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:25.220
DM: studying and, and praying and, you know, every day, um,

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:36.980
DM: learning a little bit more about the, the history of Shakun and the sort of, um, mythos of her and her power, and also practicing and strengthening

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:41.380
DM: your connection to this web of power that, um,

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:42.540
DM: that

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:46.160
DM: maintains this, this defense of Dunmar.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:55.160
DM: So it's a lot of, been a lot of like meditation and, um, just spending time sort of focusing on how power flows through this network of people.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:57.040
DM: Um,

00:00:58.960 --> 00:00:59.260
DM: and

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:10.160
DM: because... So Kendressa also spends some time sort of telling you about, about the, the sort of history of the initiation ceremony, and he says it'll be a little

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:13.400
DM: bit strange because you've already experienced some of it.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.600
Unknown: [clears throat]

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:17.260
DM: Um, having gone through this ritual before without the heart.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:20.300
DM: Um, but what is different is that

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:28.800
DM: now the presence of the heart will be there to guide you, and things that didn't make sense may make more sense, he hopes.

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:30.280
DM: Um,

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:34.540
DM: and the initiation itself is also the story of-

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:35.740
Unknown: [coughs]

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:45.800
DM: ... Shakun's, not exactly her history, but her power and her sort of spirit and connection

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:46.420
DM: to Dunmar.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:54.420
DM: And so after a week of training and meditation and prayer, um, the,

00:01:55.620 --> 00:02:01.040
DM: the last evening before the Feast of Bishma, so the night before, so next...

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:04.200
DM: We'll start the session the morning after the initiation.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:05.420
DM: Um,

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:08.600
DM: he takes you down again

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:19.960
DM: to the... through the temple to the same room that you were in previously, down through the common area of the temple, um, down underground

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:21.020
DM: into this cavern

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:24.220
DM: where there's a pool of glowing water.

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:25.200
Unknown: [clears throat]

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.200
DM: Except that now the room is brightly lit,

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:31.820
DM: and you can see that there, instead of a dark room before, um,

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:33.920
DM: there is a,

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.140
DM: there is, um,

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:44.900
DM: a warm glow that comes from the rock all around this, the chamber that, um, all around the, the walls-

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:45.080
Unknown: [clears throat]

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:48.680
DM: ... that surround this pool of water in the middle of this chamber.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:52.860
DM: The just glowing sort of burnished red like the sunset.

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:58.200
DM: Basically walked into a, a, a living sunset almost, or sunrise.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.320
DM: So everything is warm and, and bright.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:03.360
DM: Um,

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:07.360
DM: and he says, "This is the power of Shakun's heart.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.760
DM: With her here, the mesa is alive,

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:16.980
DM: bright and powerful and not

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:18.520
DM: dark."

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:21.940
DM: And as before, he,

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:32.780
DM: um, you change into the robes of the initiates, and he paints a, um, a crescent on your forehead with this red ochre pigment made from the mesa itself, which

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:34.900
DM: now also is glowing.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:39.660
DM: And you feel this glow sort of suffuse into you in this, um...

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:52.220
DM: It's almost as if you feel somebody, uh, something kind of wrapping its arm around your spirit, around your aura, and leading you to, um,

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:57.140
DM: to this, this water, this pool of water.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:03.000
DM: And just as before, the, the priest, the acolyte who's helping with the ceremony...

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:10.460
DM: You know, this is-- You're the only two ones, um, participating in this because, you know, normally there would be...

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:13.740
DM: There's a cycle. There's initiation every year or something like that.

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:16.200
DM: That already happened, um,

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:20.040
DM: and, and you're sort of being initiated off cycle.

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:24.000
DM: But because of the circumstances, Kendressa has been in favor of this.

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:28.360
DM: So it's just the two of you.

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:31.300
DM: Um, but as before, the, um,

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:43.000
DM: the flames of the pool, the p- surface of the pool bursts into this blue light, um, and the a- the acolyte leads you to the pool, gives you a drink of

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:43.520
DM: something,

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.980
DM: and submerges you underneath the flames.

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:50.880
DM: And as before,

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:57.820
DM: for a moment, everything is darkness until your vision adjusts and

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:01.020
DM: you're looking down now, um,

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:03.160
DM: at,

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:09.260
DM: um... You're, you're flying over the land of Dunmar from west to east.

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:19.380
DM: So starting in this tumbled scrubland of rock and grass and low hills near the border of Chardin, along the outskirts of the

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:26.760
DM: mountains that are Drakard's home, and then turning south along the river, um, passing across the plains and into the desert.

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:38.960
DM: Then a, turning west again to the Yuvanti Mountains, flying up, approaching the mountains and soaring over the steep high peaks of the mountains and looking at the,

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:46.520
DM: um, the savannas and to the, to the south, the lush jungles beyond the mountains.

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:49.440
Unknown: [clears throat]

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:52.880
DM: And as you fly across this land, you can,

00:05:54.580 --> 00:06:06.104
DM: your, you can feel yourself being, being buoyed up by some presence, and it's, and you're circling around the mesa basically, which is at the center of this land.

00:06:06.104 --> 00:06:09.944
DM: And as you circle around, the land becomes almost a blur almost.

00:06:10.704 --> 00:06:10.884
DM: Um,

00:06:12.404 --> 00:06:13.724
DM: the plains, the, the

00:06:15.024 --> 00:06:17.844
DM: tall grasses of the, of the north, the deserts.

00:06:18.684 --> 00:06:21.564
DM: Um, and you dr- as you drift higher and higher,

00:06:22.964 --> 00:06:23.124
DM: um,

00:06:24.724 --> 00:06:25.724
DM: you hear a voice,

00:06:27.064 --> 00:06:30.964
DM: maybe Kendros's, you're not entirely sure, um,

00:06:33.284 --> 00:06:34.904
DM: that says, "Look to the past."

00:06:36.644 --> 00:06:38.004
DM: And the land changes.

00:06:39.124 --> 00:06:40.704
DM: And now before you, you see

00:06:41.944 --> 00:06:43.204
DM: this vast

00:06:44.324 --> 00:06:48.144
DM: forest covering the entire land.

00:06:50.924 --> 00:06:57.464
DM: A m- massive forest, like huge trees, um, stretching as far as the eye can see.

00:06:59.544 --> 00:06:59.704
DM: Um,

00:07:00.724 --> 00:07:06.824
DM: the sound, occasional sound of singing in a strange language, dancing across the top of the trees.

00:07:08.024 --> 00:07:09.664
DM: And the voice says again,

00:07:11.184 --> 00:07:12.644
DM: "This is what was here before."

00:07:14.404 --> 00:07:15.864
Unknown: Where's the mesa in the forest?

00:07:17.124 --> 00:07:17.524
DM: Uh,

00:07:19.324 --> 00:07:21.064
DM: the, the mesa is,

00:07:22.504 --> 00:07:22.884
DM: um...

00:07:25.124 --> 00:07:29.224
DM: It's not, it's not quite directly in the center of the forest.

00:07:30.484 --> 00:07:34.524
DM: Um, it's, it's a bit north of the center of the forest.

00:07:34.524 --> 00:07:37.164
DM: The forest stretches south all the way down to the coast.

00:07:38.004 --> 00:07:42.164
Kenzo: I, I guess what I'm asking is, like, where the mesa is now, you know, which obviously is, like-

00:07:42.424 --> 00:07:42.484
DM: Right

00:07:42.484 --> 00:07:45.684
Kenzo: ... significant. Like, when the forest was there, is there, like,

00:07:46.784 --> 00:07:47.484
Unknown: a huge tree there?

00:07:47.484 --> 00:07:47.804
DM: Oh, yeah. You can still s-

00:07:47.804 --> 00:07:48.104
Unknown: Or like a-

00:07:48.164 --> 00:07:50.724
DM: So it, so it's not a mesa, y- but you can still see it.

00:07:50.724 --> 00:07:52.484
DM: There is a, um...

00:07:53.864 --> 00:07:57.084
DM: So, so you can still see a, uh...

00:07:57.524 --> 00:07:58.844
DM: It's actually, um...

00:08:02.084 --> 00:08:03.884
DM: What's the, like, inverse of a mesa?

00:08:03.884 --> 00:08:06.124
DM: [laughs] It's like a, like a...

00:08:06.124 --> 00:08:07.124
DM: It goes down, right?

00:08:07.124 --> 00:08:07.144
Unknown: Yeah.

00:08:07.144 --> 00:08:10.264
DM: It's like a, a big open sinkhole or something like that.

00:08:10.464 --> 00:08:10.724
Unknown: Uh-huh.

00:08:10.744 --> 00:08:12.004
DM: I don't know what the word for that is.

00:08:12.004 --> 00:08:13.684
Kenzo: Like a valley, but like a...

00:08:13.704 --> 00:08:13.744
Unknown: Yeah.

00:08:13.764 --> 00:08:17.144
DM: But, like, sharp sided, but not like a canyon, because it's in the forest.

00:08:17.144 --> 00:08:18.784
DM: There's trees growing up around it.

00:08:18.984 --> 00:08:19.584
Unknown: Interesting.

00:08:20.544 --> 00:08:30.964
DM: There's, there's actually one enormous tree that, like, is stretching, making this arch across, um, uh, from the side of the, of the,

00:08:30.964 --> 00:08:32.384
DM: um, of the,

00:08:33.844 --> 00:08:37.004
DM: of this, like, canyon wall around the pits to the, to the center.

00:08:37.004 --> 00:08:38.724
DM: There's just these trees that...

00:08:38.724 --> 00:08:41.544
DM: These, like, a massive, massive trees that grow.

00:08:41.544 --> 00:08:49.644
DM: These, you know, 500-foot-long branches that form these arches that connect from the stone into the living tree.

00:08:49.644 --> 00:08:53.444
DM: It's clearly a, a significant place, but it looks different.

00:08:53.444 --> 00:08:54.644
DM: But you can recognize it.

00:08:54.644 --> 00:08:55.384
DM: It's still this-

00:08:56.164 --> 00:08:56.364
Unknown: Wow

00:08:56.364 --> 00:08:59.184
DM: ... still an obvious feature on the landscape.

00:09:01.164 --> 00:09:01.304
DM: Um,

00:09:02.144 --> 00:09:04.644
DM: and as you're watching this, the, the,

00:09:05.824 --> 00:09:12.964
DM: um, the, the voice, the narration, um, says, "And then evil came."

00:09:14.704 --> 00:09:19.864
DM: And there's a flash of light, and then the fi- the forest just starts burning.

00:09:21.964 --> 00:09:23.684
DM: And it starts burning in all directions.

00:09:23.684 --> 00:09:25.604
DM: It just starts to turn to ash.

00:09:25.604 --> 00:09:35.524
DM: The fire spreads. Everything's red with flame, and you see nothing but the ash and the dead trees scattered across the land, and the smell of death and blood.

00:09:37.044 --> 00:09:39.184
DM: And the image slowly fades,

00:09:40.904 --> 00:09:48.664
DM: uh, to, to almost translucent, so you're sort of looking at a shadowy, um, the same landscape, but a shadowy realm.

00:09:52.224 --> 00:09:53.244
DM: And things were dark.

00:09:54.924 --> 00:09:57.624
Kenzo: When it said, uh, "When evil came," like, what did it look like?

00:09:57.624 --> 00:09:59.064
Unknown: Like, what destroyed the forest?

00:09:59.064 --> 00:09:59.764
Unknown: Like, was it like a-

00:10:00.304 --> 00:10:01.464
DM: A- all you see is fire.

00:10:02.204 --> 00:10:03.744
Unknown: Fire. Okay.

00:10:03.744 --> 00:10:09.104
DM: Um, there's no, there's no visual image of anything other than fire marching across the land.

00:10:09.724 --> 00:10:15.584
DM: You don't really know if that is, like, just metaphorical or if that was an actual fire.

00:10:18.704 --> 00:10:18.884
DM: Um,

00:10:20.124 --> 00:10:22.884
DM: and then there is, um,

00:10:24.363 --> 00:10:24.923
DM: wave,

00:10:26.564 --> 00:10:31.064
DM: sort of a w- several waves that come of, of, of...

00:10:32.564 --> 00:10:39.164
DM: It's almost like the land itself is, like, p- pulsing, like, um, expanding and shrinking, expanding and shrinking.

00:10:40.104 --> 00:10:40.264
DM: Um,

00:10:43.344 --> 00:10:44.264
DM: many settled,

00:10:45.704 --> 00:10:49.924
DM: and you can see cities begin to spring up on the land below.

00:10:52.644 --> 00:10:54.164
DM: But the evil was still there.

00:10:57.364 --> 00:10:57.704
DM: And

00:10:59.324 --> 00:11:03.884
DM: as these cities start to spring up, at the center of each one, there is

00:11:05.144 --> 00:11:05.404
DM: a,

00:11:07.164 --> 00:11:07.364
DM: um...

00:11:09.704 --> 00:11:14.084
DM: It's, it's almost like there's, like, a little bit of the reflection of the fire in these cities.

00:11:14.464 --> 00:11:14.504
Unknown: Yeah.

00:11:14.504 --> 00:11:18.784
DM: Like somehow the fire wasn't totally put out, and the cities kind of encapsulate the fire.

00:11:23.044 --> 00:11:23.584
DM: Until

00:11:25.544 --> 00:11:28.884
DM: death and destruction claimed the land again.

00:11:30.064 --> 00:11:31.524
DM: And from each of these cities,

00:11:32.784 --> 00:11:33.564
DM: this red

00:11:35.544 --> 00:11:37.124
DM: ooze bubbling

00:11:38.304 --> 00:11:39.704
DM: spreads across the land.

00:11:40.744 --> 00:11:43.724
DM: And again, everything that was living there turns

00:11:45.764 --> 00:11:47.884
DM: dark and blackened.

00:11:47.884 --> 00:11:51.764
DM: It's almost like acid is spilling out across this landscape that you're looking at.

00:11:52.264 --> 00:11:52.284
DM: Um-

00:11:52.284 --> 00:11:55.504
Kenzo: What, what is... Is, is Shakun, like, relevant?

00:11:55.504 --> 00:11:58.004
Kenzo: Like, does Shakun exist in all this, or this is all before Shakun?

00:11:58.484 --> 00:12:01.104
DM: This is all before. This is before Shakun.

00:12:01.644 --> 00:12:02.304
Unknown: Got it. Okay.

00:12:02.584 --> 00:12:02.704
DM: Um-

00:12:02.824 --> 00:12:05.824
Drikod: What, what are the m- what's happening closer to the mountains?

00:12:06.104 --> 00:12:09.484
Drikod: Are the, the cities that are farther north having the same thing?

00:12:10.984 --> 00:12:15.580
DM: Yeah. I mean, it spreads from the south to the north.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.380
DM: Um, [clears throat] and then,

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:22.220
DM: so it's, as it spreads, it's like acid pouring across the land.

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:24.020
DM: Everything is being blackened.

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:27.620
DM: Everything is, um, being corroded and worn away.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:29.640
DM: And then

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:35.620
DM: everything again sort of turns translucent.

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:45.480
DM: And then the voice says again, "Until the land was, land was cleaned.

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:46.840
DM: Was clean, cleansed."

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:50.600
DM: And you, you

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:54.760
DM: are sort of s- pulled up into the sky,

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:59.900
DM: and then you feel yourself disjointed, falling as rain,

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.440
DM: flowing down onto this landscape,

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:06.880
DM: washing away this acid,

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:13.820
DM: life springing up behind you as you flow from the mountains down to the rivers into the sea.

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:22.300
DM: Um, all of this, all of the ash, all of the blood, all of the fire, all of the, this corrosion being washed away.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:28.640
DM: Water pooling now

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.680
DM: at the center o- at this pit that was the mesa.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:38.980
DM: But somebody had to protect the land that was left.

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:47.880
DM: And you can f- you can see now, you can feel like the mesa starting to contract a little bit like a heart beating really.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:56.420
DM: The... It's still a pool of water, it's not a mesa yet, but this whole sinkhole, canyon, cavern has now been filled in with this water that, that was you.

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:02.080
DM: And it's now starting to slowly con- beat, slowly contract like a heart.

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:11.020
Kenzo: And you know the, um, the place where, uh, um, [clears throat] we could access the other dimension, like the, um, sh- the Shakun's realm?

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:12.220
DM: Yep.

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:15.680
Kenzo: Is that... Where was that in this whole arc?

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:16.380
DM: Uh,

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:18.280
DM: that was in, that was

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:21.440
DM: in the mesa in the current day.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:24.299
DM: You haven't seen anything that might represent that yet.

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:25.000
Unknown: Okay.

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:32.720
DM: So this water continues, um, to do this th- to do this thing.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:39.500
DM: Slowly it begins to dry out, contract a little.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:46.200
DM: So every time it, like, pulses like this, the pool gets a little bit smaller, and a little bit smaller, and a little bit smaller.

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.380
DM: And you can see the mesa start to

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:53.040
DM: stretch up, like the land almost starting to invert itself.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:57.220
DM: What was a, what was a sinkhole now beginning to rise up from the ground.

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:58.880
DM: Everything's all, um,

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:03.320
DM: you know, everything's pretty barren at this point.

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:05.180
DM: The land's just been washed clean.

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:14.420
DM: And as the, as this, um, process begins, continues, um,

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:25.180
DM: the voice says again, "The land was and will be connected by the people who believe in it."

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:27.740
DM: And

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:30.040
DM: the vision shifts.

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:30.660
Unknown: [clears throat]

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:32.160
DM: Out of this... You can sort of...

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:37.520
DM: It's almost like you're watching this now in the reflection of this pool as the mesa is growing up around the pool.

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:45.300
DM: And now you start to realize that the water that's left behind is forming itself into this pool of water that you saw before.

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:48.920
DM: That's the portal to Shakun's, um, realm.

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.960
DM: So this is, this seems to be forming as it is.

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:52.600
DM: And reflected in that you see

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:54.780
DM: walking,

00:15:55.960 --> 00:16:05.640
DM: turning a corner on a narrow track high in the mountains, seeing small trails of smoke rising in the distance from the fires of a small village.

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:16.680
DM: And you can feel the anticipation of hearing again the sounds of hammers against stone, the soft patter of young feet running over stone, the background murmur of the

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:18.080
DM: life of the small village.

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:28.840
DM: As you walk up this path approaching the village, you then see in this pool of water falling through the mountains, through the stone,

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:31.560
DM: emerging on an open plain,

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:35.520
DM: riding fast on a horse, um,

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:39.720
DM: your, a, a companion, a,

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:43.140
DM: a, a, a young boy riding beside you.

