00:32:13.296 --> 00:32:13.376
Unknown: Like...

00:32:13.496 --> 00:32:13.796
DM: Uh,

00:32:15.976 --> 00:32:17.916
DM: initially fascinated, and then

00:32:19.096 --> 00:32:22.096
