03:16:34.844 --> 03:16:37.944
DM: statues or mementos, sometimes out of wood or

03:16:39.044 --> 03:16:46.684
DM: shaped out of clay or sometimes sculpted out of a sweet honey candy that people make for the festival.

03:16:48.664 --> 03:16:49.024
DM: And so the

03:16:50.284 --> 03:16:54.724
DM: festival begins on this kind of solemn note and these morning prayers start.

03:16:54.724 --> 03:17:05.004
